---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Buku Panduan Lengkap Penggunaan - Mangga POS | Mudahkan.online"
	description="Buku panduan resmi dan tutorial terlengkap penggunaan aplikasi kasir Mangga POS. Meliputi setup toko, input produk, master catalog ritel 32.000+ produk, diskon & kategori, transaksi POS, QRIS, printer Bluetooth thermal, hingga laporan laba rugi."
>
	<!-- Top Navigation Bar -->
	<header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-100 shadow-xs">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-6 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
			<a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
				<img 
					src="/logo.png" 
					alt="Mangga POS Logo" 
					class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl shadow-xs object-cover border border-slate-200 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform" 
				/>
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
						<span class="font-black text-xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Mangga POS</span>
						<span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 rounded-md border border-orange-200">
							PANDUAN
						</span>
					</div>
					<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-semibold leading-none">by Mudahkan.online</p>
				</div>
			</a>

			<nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-bold text-slate-600">
				<a href="/" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Beranda</a>
				<a href="/#features" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Fitur</a>
				<a href="/#download" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Unduh Aplikasi</a>
				<a href="/#pricing" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Harga</a>
				<span class="text-orange-600 border-b-2 border-orange-600 pb-0.5">Buku Panduan Lengkap</span>
			</nav>

			<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
				<a 
					href="https://wa.me/6285624277920?text=Halo%20Admin%20Mangga%20POS,%20saya%20butuh%20panduan%20penggunaan" 
					target="_blank" 
					class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-md shadow-orange-500/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5"
				>
					CS WhatsApp ↗
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<!-- Guide Main Container -->
	<main class="py-10 lg:py-16 bg-slate-50 min-h-screen">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-7xl">
			
			<!-- Header Banner -->
			<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 rounded-[36px] p-8 lg:p-14 text-white shadow-xl shadow-orange-600/15 mb-12 relative overflow-hidden">
				<div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-80 h-80 bg-white/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
				<div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
					<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/30 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-5">
						📖 DOKUMENTASI & PANDUAN PENGGUNA LENGKAP
					</div>
					<h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight mb-4">
						Buku Panduan Resmi Operasional Mangga POS
					</h1>
					<p class="text-white/95 text-base lg:text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed">
						Panduan terlengkap dari A sampai Z. Pelajari cara instalasi, setup identitas toko, input produk, pemanfaatan <strong>Master Catalog 32.000+ produk ritel</strong>, diskon kategori, transaksi kasir POS, pembayaran QRIS, printer Bluetooth thermal, mode offline-first, shift kasir & petty cash, resep bahan baku BOM, promo tebus murah, menu digital self-order, hingga laporan keuangan laba rugi.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Layout Grid: Sticky Sidebar + Main Content -->
			<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[290px_1fr] gap-10 items-start">
				
				<!-- Sticky Sidebar Navigation -->
				<aside class="sticky top-28 bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs max-h-[calc(100vh-140px)] overflow-y-auto hidden lg:block">
					<h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
						Daftar Isi Panduan
					</h3>
					<nav class="space-y-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-600">
						<a href="#bab-1" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							1. Pengenalan & Instalasi
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-2" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							2. Setup Toko & Profil
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-3" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors text-orange-600 bg-orange-50/50">
							3. Master Catalog (Ritel 32k)
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-4" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							4. Input Produk, Stok & Varian
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-5" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							5. Diskon & Promosi Kategori
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-6" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							6. Transaksi Kasir POS
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-7" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors text-indigo-700 bg-indigo-50/60 font-bold">
							7. QRIS Dinamis & Virtual Soundbox 🔊
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-8" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							8. Printer Bluetooth Thermal
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-9" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							9. Menu Digital & QR Meja
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-10" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							10. Riwayat Transaksi & Tiket Dapur (KOT)
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-11" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							11. Laba Bersih, HPP & Arus Kas
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-12" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							12. Multi-Kasir & Multi-Outlet
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-13" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors text-amber-700 bg-amber-50/50">
							13. Buku Kasbon & Tempo Pelanggan
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-14" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							14. Mode Offline & Auto Sync
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-15" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							15. Shift Kasir & Petty Cash
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-16" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							16. Resep (BOM) & Promo Tebus
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-17" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
							17. Tanya Jawab (FAQ)
						</a>
						<a href="#bab-18" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors text-blue-700 bg-blue-50/50">
							18. Windows Desktop & Driver Printer 🖥️
						</a>
					</nav>

					<div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100">
						<div class="bg-orange-50/80 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-orange-200/60 text-xs text-orange-950">
							<p class="font-bold mb-1">Butuh Bantuan Langsung?</p>
							<p class="text-orange-800 text-[11px] leading-relaxed mb-3">Tim bantuan kami siap membantu setup toko Anda hingga beroperasi.</p>
							<a 
								href="https://wa.me/6285624277920" 
								target="_blank" 
								class="block text-center py-2 bg-orange-600 text-white rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 transition-colors"
							>
								Chat WhatsApp
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</aside>

				<!-- Main Content Area -->
				<div class="bg-white rounded-[36px] p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-16">
					
					<!-- BAB 1: Pengenalan & Instalasi -->
					<section id="bab-1" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-6">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg">1</span>
							<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Pengenalan & Instalasi Aplikasi</h2>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
							Mangga POS adalah sistem Point of Sale (POS) modern berbasis Cloud yang didesain fleksibel untuk berbagai lini bisnis: Restoran, Kafe, Kedai Kopi, Warung Makan, Toko Ritel/Kelontong, Minimarket, Fashion, hingga Usaha Jasa.
						</p>

						<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
							<div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">
								<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
									📥 Cara Download Aplikasi Resmi
								</h4>
								<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">
									Unduh langsung dari <strong>Google Play Store</strong> resmi untuk memastikan Anda selalu mendapatkan pembaruan versi terbaru dengan keamanan terjamin:
								</p>
								<div class="space-y-2">
									<a 
										href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=online.mudahkan.manggapos" 
										target="_blank" 
										class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-colors"
									>
										<span>Buka di Google Play Store ↗</span>
									</a>
									<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Kompatibel dengan semua smartphone dan tablet Android (Android 7.0 ke atas).</p>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">
								<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
									🔐 Login Mudah dengan Akun Google
								</h4>
								<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">
									Tekan <strong>"Lanjutkan dengan Google"</strong> dan pilih akun Gmail aktif Anda. Sistem otomatis membuat akun toko dan mencadangkan data Anda ke Cloud Supabase secara real-time.
								</p>
								<div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-[11px] text-emerald-800 font-semibold">
									💡 Saran: Gunakan akun Gmail khusus usaha Anda agar pengelolaan kasir terpisah dari data pribadi.
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- BAB 2: Setup Profil Toko & Identitas Bisnis -->
					<section id="bab-2" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-6 border-t border-slate-100 pt-12">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg">2</span>
							<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Setup Profil Bisnis & Toko</h2>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
							Atur profil toko agar data identitas usaha tercetak rapi di nota belanja pelanggan dan tampil menarik di website katalog Menu Digital:
						</p>

						<div class="space-y-4">
							<div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
								<span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">A</span>
								<div>
									<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Nama Toko & Tipe Bisnis</h4>
									<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
										Buka menu drawer samping ➔ <strong>Profil Bisnis</strong> ➔ Tekan <strong>Edit Profil Bisnis</strong>. Masukkan Nama Toko (contoh: <em>Toko Berkah Makmur</em>) dan pilih tipe (Ritel / Makanan & Minuman / Jasa).
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
								<span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">B</span>
								<div>
									<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Handle & Slug Akses Katalog Publik</h4>
									<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
										Tentukan nama slug unik tanpa spasi, misalnya: <code>toko-berkah</code>. Link Menu Digital toko Anda otomatis aktif di <code>pos.mudahkan.online/s/toko-berkah</code> untuk dibagikan ke media sosial atau pelanggan.
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
								<span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">C</span>
								<div>
									<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Nomor WhatsApp & Alamat</h4>
									<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
										Cantumkan nomor telepon WhatsApp aktif dan alamat gerai Anda. Informasi ini otomatis ditampilkan di header cetak struk kasir dan tombol chat pemesanan.
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- BAB 3: Fitur Master Catalog (Ritel 32k) -->
					<section id="bab-3" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-6 border-t border-slate-100 pt-12">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-orange-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg">3</span>
							<div>
								<div class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">FITUR UNGGULAN RITEL</div>
								<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Master Catalog (32.000+ Produk Siap Pakai)</h2>
							</div>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
							Khusus bagi pemilik toko kelontong, minimarket, warung sembako, dan toko ritel, <strong>Anda tidak perlu mengetik nama dan mencari barcode produk satu per satu dari nol</strong>. Mangga POS telah dilengkapi database <strong>Master Catalog</strong> berisi lebih dari <strong>32.000 produk konsumen (FMCG) Indonesia</strong>.
						</p>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border-2 border-orange-200 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-5">
							<h4 class="text-lg font-black text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2">
								🚀 Cara Praktis Menggunakan Master Catalog:
							</h4>
							
							<div class="space-y-4">
								<div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white/90 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-orange-200/60 shadow-xs">
									<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-orange-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
									<div>
										<strong class="text-slate-900 text-sm">Buka Menu Tambah Produk</strong>
										<p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5">
											Masuk ke menu <strong>Katalog Produk</strong> ➔ Tekan tombol <strong>+ Tambah Produk</strong>.
										</p>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white/90 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-orange-200/60 shadow-xs">
									<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-orange-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
									<div>
										<strong class="text-slate-900 text-sm">Scan Barcode Fisik atau Ketik Nama Produk</strong>
										<p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5">
											Arahkan kamera HP ke barcode kemasan barang (misal: <em>Indomie Goreng, Aqua 600ml, Minyak Bimoli, Sabun Lifebuoy</em>) atau ketik nama barang pada kolom pencarian Master Catalog.
										</p>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white/90 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-orange-200/60 shadow-xs">
									<span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-orange-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
									<div>
										<strong class="text-slate-900 text-sm">Otomatis Terisi & Simpan ke Toko Anda</strong>
										<p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5">
											Sistem seketika mengisi Nama Barang, Barcode resmi, Kategori Ritel, Satuan (Pcs/Btl), serta estimasi harga standar. Anda tinggal menyesuaikan <strong>Harga Jual toko Anda</strong> dan memasukkan <strong>Jumlah Stok yang tersedia</strong>, lalu tekan Simpan!
										</p>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-300 text-xs text-amber-900 font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-xl">⚡</span>
								<span>Input 100 produk minimarket kini selesai hanya dalam hitungan menit tanpa repot mengetik manual!</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- BAB 4: Input Produk Manual, Stok & Varian -->
					<section id="bab-4" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-6 border-t border-slate-100 pt-12">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg">4</span>
							<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Input Produk Manual, Stok & Varian</h2>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
							Untuk produk buatan sendiri, kuliner, atau barang yang tidak ada barcode pabrikannya, gunakan input manual lengkap dengan rincian berikut:
						</p>

						<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
							<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xs space-y-2">
								<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 text-[11px] font-bold">1. Data Dasar & Foto</span>
								<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Nama, Kategori & Foto Produk</h4>
								<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
									Unggah foto produk yang jelas. Pilih kategori yang sesuai (misal: <em>Makanan, Minuman, Snack, Rokok</em>). Foto akan otomatis tampil di layar kasir dan web Menu Digital.
								</p>
							</div>

							<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xs space-y-2">
								<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-bold">2. Harga & HPP (Modal)</span>
								<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Kalkulasi Laba Otomatis</h4>
								<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
									Masukkan <strong>Harga Jual</strong> dan <strong>Harga Modal (HPP)</strong>. Selisih antara harga jual dan modal akan otomatis dihitung sebagai keuntungan kotor pada laporan harian toko.
								</p>
							</div>

							<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xs space-y-2">
								<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 text-[11px] font-bold">3. Manajemen Stok & Peringatan</span>
								<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Low Stock Alert</h4>
								<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
									Aktifkan fitur stok dan atur batas minimum (misal: 5 pcs). Saat sisa barang mencapai batas tersebut, aplikasi akan memberikan peringatan agar Anda segera restock.
								</p>
							</div>

							<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xs space-y-2">
								<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-[11px] font-bold">4. Varian & Topping (Add-ons)</span>
								<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Opsi Fleksibel</h4>
								<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
									Tambahkan varian ukuran (Reguler / Jumbo), suhu (Panas / Es), level pedas, atau topping tambahan berbayar (Keju +3.000). Kasir tinggal memilih opsi ini saat transaksi.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<!-- BAB 5: Diskon & Promosi Kategori -->
					<section id="bab-5" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-6 border-t border-slate-100 pt-12">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg">5</span>
							<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Manajemen Diskon & Promosi Toko</h2>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
							Buat promo menarik untuk meningkatkan transaksi pelanggan. Mangga POS menyediakan berbagai opsi diskon yang fleksibel:
						</p>

						<div class="space-y-4">
							<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 space-y-2">
								<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
									🏷️ 1. Diskon per Kategori Produk
								</h4>
								<p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
